<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Geopolitical Intelligence Center</title>

<style>

:root{
--green:#143226;
--green-light:#204737;
--green-card:#1c3d2f;
--green-deep:#0d2119;
--cream:#F4EEE2;
--cream-dark:#d8cfbf;
--gold:#C4A06D;
--gold-light:#ddbc8a;
--gold-dark:#8d6b3f;

--low:#7fae8a;
--emerging:#d6b65c;
--significant:#d8934b;
--high:#d36b5d;
}

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;
background:var(--green);
color:var(--cream);
line-height:1.7;
}

/* =========================
HERO
========================= */

.hero{
padding:100px 30px;
text-align:center;
background:
linear-gradient(
rgba(20,50,38,.82),
rgba(20,50,38,.94)
),
url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521295121783-8a321d551ad2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80");
background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
border-bottom:3px solid var(--gold);
}

.hero h1{
font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem);
margin-bottom:20px;
color:white;
}

.hero p{
max-width:850px;
margin:auto;
font-size:1.15rem;
opacity:.95;
}

.hero-buttons{
margin-top:35px;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
gap:15px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
}

.btn{
padding:14px 28px;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:10px;
font-weight:700;
transition:.3s;
display:inline-block;
}

.btn-primary{
background:var(--gold);
color:#111;
}

.btn-primary:hover{
background:var(--gold-light);
transform:translateY(-2px);
}

.btn-secondary{
border:1px solid var(--gold);
color:var(--cream);
}

.btn-secondary:hover{
background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

/* =========================
CONTAINER
========================= */

.container{
max-width:1400px;
margin:auto;
padding:60px 25px;
}

/* =========================
SECTION TITLES
========================= */

.section-title{
font-size:2rem;
margin-bottom:15px;
color:var(--gold-light);
border-left:5px solid var(--gold);
padding-left:15px;
}

.section-intro{
max-width:850px;
margin-bottom:30px;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

/* =========================
GRID
========================= */

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:70px;
}

/* =========================
STANDARD CARDS
========================= */

.card{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:25px;
border-radius:18px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
transition:.35s;
}

.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-8px);
border-color:var(--gold);
}

.card h3{
margin-bottom:15px;
color:var(--gold-light);
}

.card p{
opacity:.9;
}

/* =========================
DASHBOARD
========================= */

.dashboard-guide{
background:linear-gradient(
135deg,
#234737,
#102a20
);
border:1px solid rgba(196,160,109,.35);
border-radius:20px;
padding:30px;
margin-bottom:35px;
}

.dashboard-guide h3{
color:var(--gold-light);
margin-bottom:10px;
font-size:1.4rem;
}

.dashboard-guide p{
max-width:900px;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

.range-legend{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));
gap:12px;
margin-top:25px;
}

.range-item{
padding:14px;
border-radius:10px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);
}

.range-item strong{
display:block;
margin-bottom:4px;
}

.range-low strong{
color:var(--low);
}

.range-emerging strong{
color:var(--emerging);
}

.range-significant strong{
color:var(--significant);
}

.range-high strong{
color:var(--high);
}

.dashboard-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:40px;
}

.intel-card{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:30px;
border-radius:20px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
transition:.3s;
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
}

.intel-card:hover{
transform:translateY(-6px);
border-color:var(--gold);
}

.intel-card h3{
margin-bottom:15px;
color:var(--gold-light);
font-size:1.2rem;
}

/* SCORE */

.score-row{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:space-between;
gap:15px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.score{
font-size:3rem;
font-weight:900;
color:var(--gold);
line-height:1;
}

.signal-status{
padding:6px 12px;
border-radius:30px;
font-size:.72rem;
font-weight:800;
letter-spacing:.5px;
}

.status-low{
background:rgba(127,174,138,.15);
color:var(--low);
border:1px solid rgba(127,174,138,.4);
}

.status-emerging{
background:rgba(214,182,92,.12);
color:var(--emerging);
border:1px solid rgba(214,182,92,.4);
}

.status-significant{
background:rgba(216,147,75,.12);
color:var(--significant);
border:1px solid rgba(216,147,75,.4);
}

.status-high{
background:rgba(211,107,93,.12);
color:var(--high);
border:1px solid rgba(211,107,93,.4);
}

/* RANGE BAR */

.range-bar{
width:100%;
height:9px;
background:#0e241b;
border-radius:20px;
overflow:hidden;
margin:18px 0 8px;
}

.range-fill{
height:100%;
border-radius:20px;
background:linear-gradient(
90deg,
var(--low),
var(--emerging),
var(--significant),
var(--high)
);
}

.range-label{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
font-size:.72rem;
color:rgba(244,238,226,.55);
margin-bottom:22px;
}

/* SIGNAL INFORMATION */

.signal-section{
margin-top:18px;
padding-top:18px;
border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.signal-label{
display:block;
font-size:.7rem;
letter-spacing:1.5px;
font-weight:800;
color:var(--gold);
margin-bottom:5px;
}

.signal-section p{
font-size:.92rem;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

/* STRATEGIC ACTION */

.action-box{
margin-top:20px;
padding:18px;
background:rgba(0,0,0,.12);
border-radius:12px;
border-left:3px solid var(--gold);
}

.action-box strong{
display:block;
color:var(--gold-light);
font-size:.85rem;
margin-bottom:6px;
}

.action-box ul{
padding-left:18px;
font-size:.88rem;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

.action-box li{
margin-bottom:5px;
}

/* =========================
STRATEGIC RESPONSE
========================= */

.strategy-panel{
background:linear-gradient(
135deg,
#1d4434,
#102a20
);
padding:45px;
border-radius:24px;
border:1px solid rgba(196,160,109,.25);
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.strategy-panel h2{
color:var(--gold-light);
font-size:2rem;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.strategy-panel > p{
max-width:900px;
color:var(--cream-dark);
margin-bottom:30px;
}

.strategy-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));
gap:18px;
}

.strategy-step{
background:rgba(0,0,0,.15);
padding:22px;
border-radius:16px;
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}

.step-number{
display:inline-flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
width:32px;
height:32px;
border-radius:50%;
background:var(--gold);
color:#102a20;
font-weight:900;
font-size:.85rem;
margin-bottom:12px;
}

.strategy-step h3{
color:var(--gold-light);
font-size:1.05rem;
margin-bottom:8px;
}

.strategy-step p{
font-size:.9rem;
color:var(--cream-dark);
}

/* =========================
ACTION MATRIX
========================= */

.action-matrix{
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.matrix-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
gap:20px;
}

.matrix-card{
padding:25px;
border-radius:18px;
background:var(--green-card);
border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.matrix-card h3{
margin-bottom:12px;
color:var(--gold-light);
}

.matrix-card ul{
padding-left:18px;
color:var(--cream-dark);
font-size:.92rem;
}

.matrix-card li{
margin-bottom:8px;
}

/* =========================
THINKING QUESTIONS
========================= */

.questions{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.question-box{
background:linear-gradient(
135deg,
#234737,
#163429
);
padding:30px;
border-radius:18px;
border-left:4px solid var(--gold);
transition:.3s;
}

.question-box:hover{
transform:translateY(-5px);
}

.question-box p{
font-size:1.05rem;
}

/* =========================
FEED
========================= */

.feed{
display:grid;
gap:18px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.feed-item{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:20px;
border-radius:12px;
border-left:4px solid var(--gold);
}

/* =========================
SIMULATOR
========================= */

.simulation-grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.sim-card{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:30px;
border-radius:18px;
text-align:center;
transition:.3s;
}

.sim-card:hover{
transform:translateY(-6px);
border:1px solid var(--gold);
}

.sim-card h3{
margin-bottom:15px;
color:var(--gold-light);
}

/* =========================
TIMELINE
========================= */

.timeline{
display:grid;
gap:25px;
margin-bottom:80px;
}

.timeline-item{
background:var(--green-card);
padding:25px;
border-radius:16px;
position:relative;
padding-left:35px;
}

.timeline-item::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:12px;
top:28px;
width:10px;
height:10px;
background:var(--gold);
border-radius:50%;
}

/* =========================
BRIDGE
========================= */

.bridge{
text-align:center;
background:linear-gradient(
135deg,
#234737,
#173126
);
padding:70px 30px;
border-radius:25px;
margin-bottom:50px;
}

.bridge h2{
font-size:2.3rem;
margin-bottom:20px;
color:var(--gold-light);
}

.bridge p{
max-width:800px;
margin:auto;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

/* =========================
FOOTER
========================= */

footer{
padding:40px;
text-align:center;
border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
opacity:.8;
}

/* =========================
MOBILE
========================= */

@media(max-width:768px){

.hero{
padding:80px 20px;
}

.hero h1{
font-size:2.4rem;
}

.container{
padding:45px 18px;
}

.section-title{
font-size:1.5rem;
}

.strategy-panel{
padding:28px 20px;
}

.score{
font-size:2.5rem;
}

}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<section class="hero">

<h1>Geopolitical Intelligence Center</h1>

<p>
Understand the hidden forces shaping opportunity,
wealth creation, migration, technology competition,
resource control, labor markets, infrastructure,
and long-term economic power.
</p>

<div class="hero-buttons">

<a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">
Open Career Intelligence Lab
</a>

<a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">
View Strategic Command
</a>

</div>

</section>

<div class="container">

<h2 class="section-title">Global Strategic Dashboard</h2>

<p class="section-intro">
These scores are not predictions. They are strategic signals designed
to help you practice interpreting large-scale trends. The goal is not
to memorize the number. The goal is to ask what the signal could mean
for your skills, career, business, investments, location, or future
opportunities.
</p>

<!-- DASHBOARD GUIDE -->

<div class="dashboard-guide">

<h3>How to Read the Intelligence Range</h3>

<p>
A higher score suggests that a force may have greater strategic
importance within this learning model. The correct response is not
always immediate action. First investigate the signal, identify the
possible consequences, and decide whether preparation, research, or
action makes sense.
</p>

<div class="range-legend">

<div class="range-item range-low">
<strong>0–25 • MONITOR</strong>
Early or lower-impact signal. Continue observing.
</div>

<div class="range-item range-emerging">
<strong>26–50 • INVESTIGATE</strong>
A developing trend worth researching further.
</div>

<div class="range-item range-significant">
<strong>51–75 • PREPARE</strong>
A significant force that may justify strategic preparation.
</div>

<div class="range-item range-high">
<strong>76–100 • HIGH IMPACT</strong>
A major signal. Analyze possible consequences and strategic responses.
</div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-grid">

<!-- POPULATION -->

<div class="intel-card">

<h3>Population Shift Index</h3>

<div class="score-row">
<div class="score">78</div>
<span class="signal-status status-high">HIGH IMPACT</span>
</div>

<div class="range-bar">
<div class="range-fill" style="width:78%;"></div>
</div>

<div class="range-label">
<span>0</span>
<span>25</span>
<span>50</span>
<span>75</span>
<span>100</span>
</div>

<div class="signal-section">
<span class="signal-label">WHAT IT MAY SIGNAL</span>
<p>
Migration, aging populations, and changing workforce availability may
reshape labor markets, housing, healthcare, and regional economic growth.
</p>
</div>

<div class="signal-section">
<span class="signal-label">STRATEGIC QUESTION</span>
<p>
Which industries, skills, or regions could experience increased demand
because of population changes?
</p>
</div>

<div class="action-box">
<strong>WHAT YOU CAN DO</strong>
<ul>
<li>Research growing occupations.</li>
<li>Study regions with expanding opportunity.</li>
<li>Identify industries serving changing populations.</li>
</ul>
</div>

</div>

<!-- WATER -->

<div class="intel-card">

<h3>Water Security</h3>

<div class="score-row">
<div class="score">64</div>
<span class="signal-status status-significant">PREPARE</span>
</div>

<div class="range-bar">
<div class="range-fill" style="width:64%;"></div>
</div>

<div class="range-label">
<span>0</span>
<span>25</span>
<span>50</span>
<span>75</span>
<span>100</span>
</div>

<div class="signal-section">
<span class="signal-label">WHAT IT MAY SIGNAL</span>
<p>
Water systems and infrastructure may become increasingly important for
agriculture, cities, manufacturing, and regional resilience.
</p>
</div>

<div class="signal-section">
<span class="signal-label">STRATEGIC QUESTION</span>
<p>
What industries could grow as governments and businesses invest in
water efficiency, infrastructure, and resilience?
</p>
</div>

<div class="action-box">
<strong>WHAT YOU CAN DO</strong>
<ul>
<li>Research infrastructure careers.</li>
<li>Study environmental technology.</li>
<li>Look for companies solving resource problems.</li>
</ul>
</div>

</div>

<!-- ENERGY -->

<div class="intel-card">

<h3>Energy Transition</h3>

<div class="score-row">
<div class="score">91</div>
<span class="signal-status status-high">HIGH IMPACT</span>
</div>

<div class="range-bar">
<div class="range-fill" style="width:91%;"></div>
</div>

<div class="range-label">
<span>0</span>
<span>25</span>
<span>50</span>
<span>75</span>
<span>100</span>
</div>

<div class="signal-section">
<span class="signal-label">WHAT IT MAY SIGNAL</span>
<p>
Changes in energy production, storage, efficiency, and infrastructure
could reshape manufacturing, transportation, construction, and technology.
</p>
</div>

<div class="signal-section">
<span class="signal-label">STRATEGIC QUESTION</span>
<p>
Which skills and businesses benefit when energy systems change?
</p>
</div>

<div class="action-box">
<strong>WHAT YOU CAN DO</strong>
<ul>
<li>Study energy-related industries.</li>
<li>Research technical and infrastructure skills.</li>
<li>Track companies building supporting systems.</li>
</ul>
</div>

</div>

<!-- AI -->

<div class="intel-card">

<h3>AI Competition</h3>

<div class="score-row">
<div class="score">95</div>
<span class="signal-status status-high">HIGH IMPACT</span>
</div>

<div class="range-bar">
<div class="range-fill" style="width:95%;"></div>
</div>

<div class="range-label">
<span>0</span>
<span>25</span>
<span>50</span>
<span>75</span>
<span>100</span>
</div>

<div class="signal-section">
<span class="signal-label">WHAT IT MAY SIGNAL</span>
<p>
Automation and AI adoption may change job tasks, productivity,
business models, and the value of different skills.
</p>
</div>

<div class="signal-section">
<span class="signal-label">STRATEGIC QUESTION</span>
<p>
Which parts of your work could be automated, and which capabilities
become more valuable when automation increases?
</p>
</div>

<div class="action-box">
<strong>WHAT YOU CAN DO</strong>
<ul>
<li>Learn to work with AI tools.</li>
<li>Build projects demonstrating AI-assisted capability.</li>
<li>Strengthen skills involving judgment and problem solving.</li>
</ul>
</div>

</div>

</div>

<!-- STRATEGIC RESPONSE SYSTEM -->

<section class="strategy-panel">

<h2>Don't Just Observe the Signal. Build a Response.</h2>

<p>
The purpose of strategic intelligence is not to collect interesting
information. Information becomes useful when it changes what you
investigate, learn, build, prepare for, or avoid. Use every major
signal as the beginning of a decision process.
</p>

<div class="strategy-grid">

<div class="strategy-step">
<div class="step-number">1</div>
<h3>Observe</h3>
<p>
Identify the trend or recurring signal without immediately assuming
you know what it means.
</p>
</div>

<div class="strategy-step">
<div class="step-number">2</div>
<h3>Investigate</h3>
<p>
Look for evidence, causes, affected industries, regions, and possible
second-order consequences.
</p>
</div>

<div class="strategy-step">
<div class="step-number">3</div>
<h3>Connect</h3>
<p>
Ask how the trend connects to your career, skills, projects, business,
or future opportunities.
</p>
</div>

<div class="strategy-step">
<div class="step-number">4</div>
<h3>Prepare</h3>
<p>
Build knowledge, skills, relationships, or evidence before a trend
becomes obvious to everyone else.
</p>
</div>

<div class="strategy-step">
<div class="step-number">5</div>
<h3>Test</h3>
<p>
Run a small experiment. Build a project, research a market, learn a
tool, or investigate an emerging opportunity.
</p>
</div>

<div class="strategy-step">
<div class="step-number">6</div>
<h3>Review</h3>
<p>
Update your understanding when new information appears. Strategy is a
continuous learning process.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- ACTION MATRIX -->

<h2 class="section-title">What Should You Do With Strategic Information?</h2>

<p class="section-intro">
Different signals require different responses. A trend does not always
mean you should immediately change careers, move, invest money, or
start a business. The first response may simply be learning.
</p>

<div class="action-matrix">

<div class="matrix-grid">

<div class="matrix-card">
<h3>Learn</h3>
<ul>
<li>Study the trend.</li>
<li>Learn the vocabulary.</li>
<li>Understand the affected systems.</li>
<li>Identify important skills.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="matrix-card">
<h3>Map</h3>
<ul>
<li>Identify industries affected.</li>
<li>Compare regions.</li>
<li>Find growing occupations.</li>
<li>Track organizations involved.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="matrix-card">
<h3>Build</h3>
<ul>
<li>Create a research project.</li>
<li>Build a portfolio piece.</li>
<li>Test a business idea.</li>
<li>Develop relevant evidence.</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="matrix-card">
<h3>Prepare</h3>
<ul>
<li>Develop a useful skill.</li>
<li>Reduce a personal constraint.</li>
<li>Build relationships.</li>
<li>Create more future options.</li>
</ul>
</div>

</div>

</div>

<h2 class="section-title">Five Forces Reshaping Opportunity</h2>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h3>Demographic Reality</h3>
<p>
Many countries face aging populations while others have expanding
workforces. Population structure changes labor markets, taxation,
housing demand, and future economic growth.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Water & Agriculture</h3>
<p>
Food production depends on stable water systems. Regions that solve
water challenges may create long-term opportunities in infrastructure,
technology, and resource management.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Infrastructure Power</h3>
<p>
Ports, rail systems, roads, energy grids, and internet connectivity
can strongly influence economic competitiveness and business activity.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Technology Sovereignty</h3>
<p>
Semiconductors, AI systems, automation, and advanced manufacturing
are increasingly important strategic capabilities.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Talent Competition</h3>
<p>
Countries and organizations compete for entrepreneurs, engineers,
scientists, and skilled workers. Human capability can create
long-term strategic advantage.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h3>Supply Chain Control</h3>
<p>
Shipping routes, logistics, energy networks, and access to critical
resources can create strategic leverage and economic resilience.
</p>
</div>

</div>

<h2 class="section-title">Opportunity Migration Simulator</h2>

<div class="simulation-grid">

<div class="sim-card">
<h3>High Cost Economy</h3>
<p>
Higher wages may be balanced by greater competition and increased
living costs. Analyze the tradeoffs rather than focusing on income alone.
</p>
</div>

<div class="sim-card">
<h3>Growth Economy</h3>
<p>
Rapid development can create opportunities for entrepreneurs,
specialists, infrastructure providers, and early entrants.
</p>
</div>

<div class="sim-card">
<h3>Remote Economy</h3>
<p>
Global digital work can separate where income is earned from where
someone chooses to live, depending on skills and available opportunities.
</p>
</div>

